    "flow_gAVTzH": {
      "type": "flow",
      "blocks": {
        "media_NayzzC": {
          "type": "media",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/pexels-funkcines-terapijos-centras-927573878-20860586.jpg",
            "show_sound_control": false,
            "video_url": "",
            "video_alt_text": "",
            "enable_video_autoplay": false,
            "subheading": "",
            "heading": "BONE HEALTH EVALUATION",
            "image_style_heading": "square",
            "image_ratio_heading": "aspect-16/9",
            "description": "<p>The Aiwo DEXA scan provides a fast and highly accurate assessment of bone mineral density. It measures the strength and quality of your bones, especially focused on areas susceptible to osteoporosis or fractures, such as the spine and hips. This evaluation helps in early detection of bone loss and risk assessment for osteoporosis or other metabolic bone conditions.</p>",
            "button_text": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "open_new_window_button": false,
            "show_button_style": "text-link"
          }
        },
        "media_4VUdUM": {
          "type": "media",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/pexels-funkcines-terapijos-centras-927573878-20860586.jpg",
            "show_sound_control": false,
            "video_url": "",
            "video_alt_text": "",
            "enable_video_autoplay": false,
            "subheading": "",
            "heading": "BODY COMPOSITION ANALYSIS",
            "image_style_heading": "square",
            "image_ratio_heading": "aspect-16/9",
            "description": "<p>Aiwo’s DEXA scan delivers a comprehensive analysis of your body composition, breaking down the proportions of bone, fat, and lean muscle in your body. This test offers precise measurements enabling a clear understanding of your physical makeup—crucial for tailoring health, fitness, and nutrition plans.</p>",
            "button_text": "8 Tests",
            "button_link": "",
            "open_new_window_button": false,
            "show_button_style": "text-link"
          }
        },
        "media_PdnWEq": {
          "type": "media",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/pexels-funkcines-terapijos-centras-927573878-20860586.jpg",
            "show_sound_control": false,
            "video_url": "",
            "video_alt_text": "",
            "enable_video_autoplay": false,
            "subheading": "",
            "heading": "MUSCLE MASS ASSESSMENT",
            "image_style_heading": "square",
            "image_ratio_heading": "aspect-16/9",
            "description": "<p>The scan calculates your lean muscle mass across different regions of your body. With Aiwo’s DEXA scan, you receive a detailed view of muscle distribution and quantity, which can be used to monitor progress in fitness training, rehabilitation, or overall muscle health maintenance.</p>",
            "button_text": "11 Tests",
            "button_link": "",
            "open_new_window_button": false,
            "show_button_style": "text-link"
          }
        },
        "media_mHeMkm": {
          "type": "media",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/pexels-funkcines-terapijos-centras-927573878-20860586.jpg",
            "show_sound_control": false,
            "video_url": "",
            "video_alt_text": "",
            "enable_video_autoplay": false,
            "subheading": "",
            "heading": "FAT PERCENTAGE MEASUREMENT",
            "image_style_heading": "square",
            "image_ratio_heading": "aspect-16/9",
            "description": "<p>Aiwo’s DEXA scan accurately quantifies your total body fat percentage, as well as the distribution of fat in specific areas (such as the trunk, arms, and legs). This helps to identify patterns such as visceral (abdominal) fat versus subcutaneous fat—information that can be critical for designing targeted interventions for weight management, metabolic health, and disease risk reduction.</p>",
            "button_text": "3 Tests",
            "button_link": "",
            "open_new_window_button": false,
            "show_button_style": "text-link"
          }
        }
      },
